{
    "title": "PetDesk - Pet Health Reminders",
    "description": "Our goal is to help your pets live longer, happier, and healthier lives. PetDesk puts you at the center of your pet\u2019s health needs by seamlessly connecting you with the best pet care professionals near you. Now it\u2019s easy to be the best pet parent you can be.\r\n\r\nEffortlessly manage your pet\u2019s health in one place with these indispensable features:\r\n\r\nAPPOINTMENTS\r\nWith our 24/7 appointment request tool, your favorite pet care providers are always just a few taps away.\r\n\r\nREMINDERS, MESSAGES AND TO DO\u2019S\r\nSync reminders and add custom to-do\u2019s to your calendar.\r\n\r\nPROVIDERS\r\nAdd and quickly view your pet care professionals in one place (veterinary clinics, grooming facilities, boarding, pet daycare, and more!).\r\n\r\nLOYALTY\r\nEarn points for every dollar spent at your favorite pet care provider locations.\r\n\r\nMEDICATION REQUESTS\r\nEasily request medication refills for your pets.",
